window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He bought the tickets. She broke his heart. Now he’s looking for a new Sarah Miller to sail the world with him.</p> <p>When Bryce’s viral TikTok exposes the ultimate betrayal—his girlfriend cheating the same day he surprises her with a round-the-world cruise—he’s left with two nonrefundable tickets, a shattered heart, and a wild idea: Find any Sarah Miller willing to take the trip instead.</p> <p>Enter the Sera Miller—curvy, charming, and cautiously intrigued. She never expected to spend seven months sharing a cabin with a heartbroken stranger. But the ocean has a funny way of stirring things up… and maybe healing them, too.</p> <p>One name. One cabin. One unforgettable adventure.</p> <p>Get swept away in this feel-good, fast-burn travel romance featuring a cinnamon-roll hero, a confident heroine, only one bed, and zero chance of cheating (except the kind that already got dumped). Guaranteed safe, steamy, and swoony with a happily ever after you’ll want to book twice.</p>"; 
